    "identity_and_abi": "Actual public PDB identity encodes void __cdecl(). Direct retail body uses no arguments and ends in a terminal jump to the existing no-argument mapping helper; no signature is inferred from the public name alone. Source filename/line-position and member/global identifiers retain their documented reconstruction caveats.",
