      "R13": "Free scalar initialization function; no virtual calls, vtable, dummy slots or class layout reconstruction. Its real mapping helper is a direct no-argument callee.",
      "R17": "Every statement initializes a real SDK attribute needed by the actual mapping call. sizeof uses the actual SDK type, not a hardcoded padding target. TRUE is the genuine BOOL value1. No fake locals, byte arrays, volatile carriers, forced blocks, artificial field globals or compiler-steering statements. Only the resolved parking comment was removed; the body and all prior42 bodies remain unchanged.",
